  "answer": "This has been reported before. An open dropdown in the Terminal settings page (Default profile, Color scheme and others) scrolls with the page and can leave the Terminal window or the screen. terminal#9320 was a WinUI bug and was fixed in Terminal Preview 1.10/1.11. It came back in later versions: terminal#16629 (Jan 2024) and terminal#18985 (May 2025) report the same behavior, and both were closed as duplicates of the earlier tickets. The archive shows no confirmed fix for the current regression, so there is no known fix. As a workaround, close the dropdown before scrolling. Choose an item or press Esc, then scroll the page. Scrolling with the mouse outside the open list is what makes it fly away. Add your version (1.24.11321.0) and build to those tickets as more evidence."
